247
00:19:54,962 --> 00:19:57,229
Iya,

248
00:19:57,252 --> 00:20:01,719
Saya akan kirim pesan malam Kamis!

249
00:20:01,741 --> 00:20:10,008
Oke, kita ketemuan pukul 4.15 di depan papan pengumuman ini ya.

250
00:20:10,031 --> 00:20:12,937
Oke.

251
00:20:12,961 --> 00:20:17,112
Tunggu hari Rabu ya!

252
00:20:17,135 --> 00:20:19,685
Iya,

253
00:20:19,709 --> 00:20:24,652
Ayo kita cari teman baru sebanyak-banyaknya!

254
00:20:24,675 --> 00:20:26,175
Scene 6: Menyesuaikan Diri dengan Rutinitas Setelah Liburan Musim Panas

255
00:20:26,175 --> 00:20:32,764
Nam-san, tadi ngantuk banget ya.

256
00:20:32,787 --> 00:20:35,973
Ngantuk, ya?

257
00:20:35,997 --> 00:20:44,350
