266
00:21:45,789 --> 00:21:54,689
Iya, sewaktu jam pertama, perut saya terus keroncongan.

267
00:21:54,712 --> 00:22:01,379
Di semester baru, penting banget untuk bisa bangun pagi.

268
00:22:01,402 --> 00:22:07,702
