389
00:32:40,468 --> 00:32:44,301
Makasih banyak!

390
00:32:44,324 --> 00:32:51,921
Kalau slide-nya sudah jadi, kita latihan hitung waktunya juga ya.

391
00:32:51,945 --> 00:32:54,612
Iya.

392
00:32:54,635 --> 00:33:00,188
Ayo kita berusaha supaya presentasinya bagus!

393
00:33:00,212 --> 00:33:04,370
Ayo semangat!

